{"id":285,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"If Shroomish senses danger, it shakes its body and scatters spores from the top of its head. This Pokémon’s spores are so toxic, they make trees and weeds wilt."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Shroomish live in damp soil in the dark depths of forests. They are often found keeping still under fallen leaves. This Pokémon feeds on compost that is made up of fallen, rotted leaves."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It prefers damp places. By day it remains still in the forest shade. It releases toxic powder from its head."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"If it senses danger, it scatters spores from the top of its head to protect itself."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It loves to eat damp, composted soil in forests. If you enter a forest after a long rain, you can see many SHROOMISH feasting on composted soil."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Effect Spore","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may inflict poison, sleep, or paralysis on the attacker."},{"name":"Poison Heal","hidden":false,"description":"If poisoned, the Pokémon has its HP restored instead of taking damage."},{"name":"Quick Feet","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Speed stat if the Pokémon has a status condition."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fluctuating","habitat":"forest","color":"Brown","shape":"Legs","evolution":{"id":285,"name":"Shroomish","condition":null,"children":[{"id":286,"name":"Breloom","condition":"Lv. 23","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,71],[5,78],[8,73],[12,72],[15,29],[19,77],[26,202],[29,74],[33,92],[36,402],[40,147]],"machine":[34,331,204,409,203,412,263,313,206,202,447,580,441,270,345,8